{"ID":"20240513083233-jg9jvcf","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083233-jg9jvcf","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083233-jg9jvcf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513133512-le11dlr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513133512-le11dlr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513133512-le11dlr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:231,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:231\u0026#125;","title":"139","type":"doc","updated":"20240515123045"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513133512-le11dlr","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 853px;","id":"20240513133512-le11dlr","updated":"20240515123045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"117-02 S, T"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"58歲,高大稍胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20080428"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡時雙踝,足水腫,早上無法穿鞋4天了,現仍有水腫"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 睡不好,無法呼吸,必需坐著睡"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 胃口中等"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 大便尚好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 胃口無,不餓"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 口渴無"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. 身溫尚好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. 無汗出"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8. 無噁心"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9. 咳嗽有,但痰不易出"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.  小便深黃,量少"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈弦數"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃厚,兩側牙痕"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肺積水"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"十棗湯  9 caps"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用紅棗粉一錢沖服"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→回去立服,服後用白水煮麵,煮很爛再吃"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"十棗湯服後藥效約三小時,吐瀉同時，故先提醒病人坐馬桶時面向洗手臺白麵吐下止後吃,不可食肉或蛋，不可加鹽“男怕腳腫,女怕頭腫”需小心處理"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}